Before both close, run one final check, not one more spam post.
First, check your rank: Fomopoly closes today, November 5, so Top 20 and ranks 21-100 are decided now.
Second, check Agent Dojo: it closes tomorrow, November 6, and Top 200 still gives a random shot at $500, even if Top 20 is out of reach.
Third, check your wallet on Rarelist, because rewards go to the connected wallet, and a missing wallet can cost you the whole batch.
Fourth, check your campaign tasks, because posting alone is not the whole score.
Every qualified post still builds RARS toward Rarelist's $50,000 Season 1 pool, so the work does not end when these two campaigns close.
Finish the checklist today, then push Agent Dojo tomorrow without spamming.

gRare 💛 

Three projects exploring different sides of participation in Web3.

@fomopoly_rh connects virtual property ownership with an in-game economy built around land, stock generation, and $DEAL.

@rarelistio focuses on creators, giving them opportunities to discover projects, share original perspectives, and gain recognition for their contributions.

@agentdojo explores AI-powered gaming, where players can customise and train fighters with distinct personalities and combat styles.

What interests me is how each project gives users a different way to contribute to its ecosystem.

From managing digital assets to creating content and developing AI fighters, there's more than one way to take part in Web3.
